WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.067 line:92%
-You shot in New Orleans.

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
Was it fun
shooting in new Orleans?

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was during
an actual festival, right?

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:05.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was during
the Essence Music Festival,

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:07.140
which happens every summer
around the Fourth of July.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
And a half a million people
descend on the city --

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:11.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
mostly women --
black women, at that.

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:15.382 size:75% position:38%
And so it was, like,
just this culture,

00:00:15.382 --> 00:00:16.649 line:92%
this fun, all this music.

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:18.485 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're seeing, like,
your favorite performers --

00:00:18.485 --> 00:00:21.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
everybody from New Edition
to Puff Daddy

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:23.289 line:92%
to Mariah Carey, Doug E. Fresh.

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:24.591 line:92%
You know, so, we were shooting

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:28.094 align:start size:94% position:6%
in all of these scenes
we're creating,

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:29.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
but it's really
their performances --

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:32.065 align:start size:94% position:6%
their actual performances
that were happening.

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:34.334
So it was hard to concentrate.
You wanted to kind of party.

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:36.469 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I can also imagine,
it must be hard

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:40.507 align:start size:94% position:6%
because you must be
so recognizable

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:42.042 align:start size:94% position:6%
to everybody
at a festival like that.

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:42.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh, yeah.
-Because you could

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:45.045 align:start size:94% position:6%
just as easily be one of
the people performing at it.

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:47.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Exactly.
-So, do people approach you

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:48.882 align:start size:94% position:6%
all the time when
you were in New Orleans?

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:50.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
Was it kind of constant?
-Oh, definitely.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:53.520 align:start size:94% position:6%
But people from New Orleans
are really cool.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:54.654 line:92%
The tourists who came in town

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:56.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
were probably
more excited to see me.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:01:00.794
But the locals are like,
"Oh, hey, baby. You good?"

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:02.996 align:start size:94% position:6%
They tell you where
to get the good gumbo,

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:06.399
the étouffée, and the drinks.
I mean, you got to love a town

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:09.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
where you can get
a drive-through daiquiri.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:10.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-They got a drive-through.

00:01:10.303 --> 00:01:11.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They figured it out.
-I'm like,

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:13.206 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Let me get this right.
You can drive

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:16.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then take this big old
slushie of daiquiri,

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:18.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she's legal?
Okay."

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:20.146 align:start size:94% position:6%
I love this place.
I always have.

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:23.083 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, yeah, one scene,
we shot in the Superdome

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:25.552 align:start size:94% position:6%
while, I think,
Mariah Carey was performing.

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:27.420
And we were trying to figure out
how to do this.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:31.891 size:78% position:39%
We know we only have
one, maybe two takes.

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:33.526 line:92%
By the third one, there's no way

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:34.694 align:start size:94% position:6%
everybody is not
gonna recognize us,

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:36.996 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause this is our fan base.
You know what I mean?

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:39.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
So we got away
with the first one.

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:41.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
The second one,
we got, like, a "Jada!"

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:43.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
or "Latifah!"
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:46.773
-By the third one, it was like,
"Regina! Jada! Latifah!

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:47.841 align:start size:94% position:6%
Wait! Look here!"
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:49.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was, like,
so many camera phones pointed,

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:51.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
we couldn't -- That was it.
The jig is up.

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.246 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We'll assume,
when we see the film,

00:01:53.246 --> 00:01:54.447 align:start size:94% position:6%
the first take was
the one you used.

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:56.216 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The first take was the one.
There's no way.

00:01:56.216 --> 00:01:58.351 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You talked about,
signing that first contract,

00:01:58.351 --> 00:01:59.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
going from Latifah
to Queen Latifah.

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:02.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you remember --
When success first came,

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:04.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
do you remember
the first thing you bought

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:06.426 size:88% position:44%
when you kind of signed
that first big contract?

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:08.695 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Chuckles ]
We bought stupid stuff

00:02:08.695 --> 00:02:10.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
with the first money we got,
I must say.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.700
You know, you give a 17-year-old
that kind of dough...

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:16.569 align:start size:94% position:6%
-i had no money at 17.
I was, like, later.

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:19.606 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I got, like,
a flat-screen and a couch.

00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:20.807 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:22.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's a good thing
to have at 17.

00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:23.877 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, exactly.

00:02:23.877 --> 00:02:25.378 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I got -- I gave --

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:27.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would always give
a third to my mom...

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:28.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, that's nice.
-...and a third

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:32.252
to put away for taxes,
which was all right at the time.

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:33.219 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:35.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
Doesn't work...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.722 --> 00:02:38.958 align:start size:94% position:6%
Works for trump,
but not for me.

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:40.460 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:41.461 size:78% position:39% line:92%
For us normal people.

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:45.565
And I would blow the other third
because I'm 17.

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:48.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What does a 17--
-I bought a Jeep Wrangler...

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:50.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right, that's good.
-...and a gold tooth.

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:52.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Chuckling ] A gold tooth?
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.939 --> 00:02:55.241 line:92%
-I always wanted a gold tooth.

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:57.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was, like, super hip-hop kid
back then.

00:02:57.677 --> 00:03:00.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I couldn't afford
a gold tooth or a gold chain.

00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:02.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
My brother and I would share
the same chain

00:03:02.415 --> 00:03:04.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
that was really my mother's.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:07.120 align:start size:94% position:6%
So we circulated
a lot of stuff like that.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.189 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I wanted a gold tooth.
So I bought

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:12.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
this, like, cheap gold tooth
at a kiosk in the mall.

00:03:12.425 --> 00:03:13.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
It didn't fit.

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:16.029 size:78% position:39%
You had to squeeze it
to make it stick on,

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:17.830 size:78% position:39%
and it would pop off
and it would pop out.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I had to stay like this
to even use it.

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:23.436
I lost that thing in a day.
I was like, "Forget this.

00:03:23.436 --> 00:03:26.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is dumb."
-Well, I'm glad

00:03:26.739 --> 00:03:28.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
you treated yourself.
-Thank you.

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:29.809 size:88% position:44%
And I'm glad things have
continued to go so well.

00:03:29.809 --> 00:03:31.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's just always
such a pleasure to see you.

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:32.645
Thank you for being here.
-Glad to be here, Seth.

00:03:32.645 --> 00:03:34.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
Keep rockin' out.
-Congrats on the film.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:37.417 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks, Queen Latifah.
-Peace, everybody!

